{"availability":"available","full":"colinsutedja/Folio","name":"Folio","description":"Privacy-conscious personal finance, budgeting, credit-card rewards, and benefit tracking PWA","category":"Finance","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-10T00:39:38Z","updated":"2026-09-10T00:39:42Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://folio-web-henna.vercel.app","topics":["nextjs","personal-finance","plaid","pwa","supabase","typescript"],"demo":"https://folio-web-henna.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:27.866Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:27.866Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:27.866Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:44:27.866Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Folio is a personal-finance and credit-card rewards tracker. The current foundation includes invite-only authentication, a responsive PWA shell, securely gated Plaid Sandbox/Production connectivity, connection repair and revocation, durable background synchronization, account and balance summaries, paginated transactions, user-reviewed categories, exact monthly budgets, a versioned card catalog, explainable reward estimates, reviewable benefit matches, normalized data export, and complete account deletion.","This repository is a recruiter-facing source snapshot of the private production project. It contains no production credentials, personal financial data, account identifiers, or private commit history. The deployed application remains invite-only because it connects to real financial accounts."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/colinsutedja/Folio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"da453c31265d7b612165956e3d2f730a7d9007c771148d2028c41d30548b1beb","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:28.051Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:28.051Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Folio is a personal-finance and credit-card rewards tracker. The curren